# Netfilter kernel-config symbols enabled for network targets
# (targets that set TARGET_NETFILTER=1). Derived from the netfilter branch's
# scripts/02-build-kernel.sh so out-of-tree netfilter modules (ipt-so, the
# xtables-addons set) build and run against a realistic netfilter kernel.
# One CONFIG symbol per line; '#' comments and blank lines are ignored.

